        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 3:54PM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North to northwest winds 15 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30
kt and waves 1 to 2 ft.

* WHERE...Currituck Sound.

* WHEN...Until 6 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
